    "description": "Last chance at this ridiculously good price for this property- seller pulling if not in contract by 12/15. Rare Telegraph Hill offering w/2 car garage now available in one of the most coveted locations in the city w/all the space you need. Currently configured as a 4 BR 3.5BA home that works as a family compound or separate units.  This legal vacant duplex is set far back from the street, & the quiet and tranquility resonate as you enter the huge zen garden and patio which is great for kids or social distancing get togethers, or relax on either of the two amazing view decks for coffee/cocktails.  You'll recognize the quality the second you walk in the door, w/tons of upgrades by current & prior owners over the last several years incl. an amazing master bath with city views from the tub, new plbg & elec, furnace & water heater, all new kitchen, reconfigured layout for open floor plan, new pantry/wet bar, roof, skylights, decks, lighting, & seismic work in the basement. All that & amazin"
  },
